Infinity+ custom OAuth
---------------------
Targets Infinity by Docile Alligator and contributors. Diagnosis was informed by
brealorg/breal-morphe-patches issue #257 and its 1.4.123 custom-client implementation,
inherited from wchill/Patcheddit. Penguin's focused implementation uses the original
Infinity app APIs directly and includes no Breal/Patcheddit runtime or shared
client credentials. Source, provenance and acceptance limits: docs/INFINITY.md.
